{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01SB4xup98zBNFvVqP3qCJ5o","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now let me generate the comprehensive median-tier predictions for all experiments.\n\n```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  C1' characterization 被多数 reviewer 接受为 solid empirical work，但 \"sole determinant\" 措辞遭挑战——\n  Mistral C4 K*=1 被 1-2 个 reviewer 解读为 model×domain interaction 而非纯 domain effect。\n  C3 curation validation 证据链被认为太弱：exp-006 effect size 小（MMLU Δ=0.76pp），exp-025/026 是 null results。\n  θ=0.60 边界选择的 robustness 被质疑（θ=0.70 下 K* 大面积降至 1）。\n  Qwen-cont CI lower=0.6015 被单独点名要求 sensitivity analysis。\n  DPI 理论框架被认为 \"nice motivation\" 但不够深入构成独立贡献。\n  ≤8B scale 被至少一个 reviewer 标记为 significant weakness。\n  整体定位：EMNLP Findings 或 conditional accept after strong rebuttal with 14B/32B evidence。\n  建议：C1' 降级为 \"primary factor\"，C3 降级为 \"case study\"，θ-sensitivity 升为主文 figure，\n  rebuttal 补充 14B/32B 结果回应 scale concern。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"mvp-001\"\n    plan_id: \"mvp_pilot_sat_v1\"\n    description: \"Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct rewrite mode pilot, C4 5K docs, depth 0-5\"\n    expected_results:\n      k_star: 2\n      pairwise_auc_0v1: 0.9956\n      pairwise_auc_1v2: 0.6957\n      pairwise_auc_2v3: 0.5893\n      pairwise_auc_3v4: 0.5434\n      pairwise_auc_4v5: 0.5343\n      ordinal_accuracy: 0.4182\n      ordinal_mae: 1.0163\n    result_rationale: >\n      Rewrite mode 因 instruction-following 引入 mode-specific style artifacts，放大 depth signal 至 1v2 AUC=0.6957。\n      在 median 档下，1-2 个 reviewer 注意到 rewrite mode 的高 AUC 不能代表 canonical condition，\n      要求论文明确将此实验定位为 \"pilot study demonstrating feasibility\"。2v3=0.5893 < θ=0.60 \n      确认 K*=2，但 reviewer 指出 rewrite mode 的 signal amplification 使 K*=2 判定比 continuation \n      更容易，质疑是否该用 rewrite 的高 AUC 作为 headline number。\n      Median 档 reviewer 接受此实验作为 motivation，但要求所有 cross-model claims 基于 continuation mode。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 1 (partial): Pairwise AUC — MVP pilot\"\n        content: |\n          | Pair | AUC    | 95% CI           | > θ=0.60? |\n          |------|--------|------------------|-----------|\n          | 0v1  | 0.9956 | [0.9946, 0.9965] | ✅ (+39.5pp) |\n          | 1v2  | 0.6957 | [0.6859, 0.7041] | ✅ (+8.6pp)  |\n          | 2v3  | 0.5893 | [0.5795, 0.5991] | ❌           |\n          | 3v4  | 0.5434 | [0.5333, 0.5551] | ❌           |\n          | 4v5  | 0.5343 | [0.5238, 0.5448] | ❌           |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"AUC decay curve (rewrite mode) — 用于 Introduction 或 §3 motivation figure，展示 sharp K*=2 boundary\"\n    analysis: >\n      Reviewer A 接受 rewrite mode 作为 pilot 合理。Reviewer B 质疑为何论文早期版本以 rewrite AUC \n      (0.6957) 为 headline 而非 continuation (0.6114)——存在 cherry-picking 嫌疑。\n      Median 档下需在论文中明确标注 mvp-001 为 pilot，所有 figure 和 headline number 基于 continuation mode。\n\n  - name: \"exp-001\"\n    plan_id: \"exp_001_pythia_depth\"\n    description: \"Pythia-1.4B, nucleus p=0.95 T=1.0, C4 5K docs, depth 0-5\"\n    expected_results:\n      k_star: 2\n      pairwise_auc_0v1: 0.9932\n      pairwise_auc_1v2: 0.6539\n      pairwise_auc_2v3: 0.5515\n      pairwise_auc_3v4: 0.5153\n      pairwise_auc_4v5: 0.5135\n      ci_1v2_lower: 0.6454\n      ci_1v2_upper: 0.6630\n      ordinal_accuracy: 0.383\n      ordinal_mae: 1.14\n    result_rationale: >\n      Pythia-1.4B 作为第一个 continuation mode 跨模型验证，1v2 AUC=0.6539 距 θ=0.60 有 +4.5pp 余量，\n      是 C4 web text 上 K*=2 的稳健证据。2v3 AUC=0.5515 远低于 θ，sharp boundary 明确。\n      在 median 档下，reviewer 接受 Pythia 的 K*=2 判定没有争议（CI lower=0.6454 >> 0.60），\n      但指出 Pythia-1.4B 作为较老架构，代表性受限——单独一个模型不足以 claim universality。\n      Reviewer 认为此结果 \"expected given information-theoretic intuition\"（A1 假设），\n      递归生成必然快速退化是直觉上合理的，K*=2 不算 surprising。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 2 (row): Pythia-1.4B C4 continuation\"\n        content: |\n          | Model | 0v1 | 1v2 | 2v3 | 3v4 | 4v5 | K* |\n          |-------|------|------|------|------|------|----|\n          | Pythia-1.4B | 0.993 | 0.654 | 0.552 | 0.515 | 0.514 | 2 |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Pairwise AUC heatmap 中的一行，展示 sharp 0v1→1v2 drop 和 2v3+ plateau\"\n    analysis: >\n      稳健但不 exciting。Median 档 reviewer 视为 \"solid but incremental evidence for a somewhat \n      expected finding\"。Pythia 的较高 1v2 AUC (vs Qwen-cont 0.6112) 减少了 borderline concern，\n      但也没有超出 reviewer 的信息论直觉预期。\n\n  - name: \"exp-002\"\n    plan_id: \"exp_002_olmo_depth\"\n    description: \"OLMo-1B, nucleus p=0.95 T=1.0, C4 5K docs, depth 0-5\"\n    expected_results:\n      k_star: 2\n      pairwise_auc_0v1: 0.997\n      pairwise_auc_1v2: 0.6146\n      pairwise_auc_2v3: 0.5497\n      pairwise_auc_3v4: 0.509\n      pairwise_auc_4v5: 0.5044\n      ci_1v2_lower: 0.6045\n      ci_1v2_upper: 0.6247\n      ordinal_accuracy: 0.3685\n      ordinal_mae: 1.1813\n    result_rationale: >\n      OLMo-1B 1v2 AUC=0.6146，CI lower=0.6045，余量 +0.45pp。比 Pythia 更边缘但仍 pass。\n      Median 档下 reviewer 注意到 OLMo 的 CI lower 只比 θ 高 0.45pp，但未被单独点名\n      （Qwen-cont 的 0.6015 更 marginal 所以吸引了注意力）。\n      OLMo 1v2=0.6146 和 Pythia 1v2=0.6539 的差异暗示 model 确实对 signal strength 有影响，\n      但两者 K* 一致=2，支持 \"domain is primary determinant\" 的 claim。\n      Reviewer 接受 Pythia↔OLMo 的一致性但指出只有两个 continuation mode 模型在此阶段不够。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 2 (row): OLMo-1B C4 continuation\"\n        content: |\n          | Model | 0v1 | 1v2 | 2v3 | 3v4 | 4v5 | K* |\n          |-------|------|------|------|------|------|----|\n          | OLMo-1B | 0.997 | 0.615 | 0.550 | 0.509 | 0.504 | 2 |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Pairwise AUC heatmap 中的一行\"\n    analysis: >\n      与 Pythia 一致，增强跨模型证据。OLMo 3v4/4v5 接近 0.50 (chance)，\n      进一步确认 depth ≥3 后信号完全消失。Reviewer 不质疑此具体结果。\n\n  - name: \"exp-003\"\n    plan_id: \"exp_003_decoding_ablation\"\n    description: \"Qwen2.5-1.5B decoding strategy ablation: greedy / nucleus p=0.9 / T=0.7 / T=1.2\"\n    expected_results:\n      k_star: 2\n      k_star_robust: true\n      greedy_1v2_auc: 0.6892\n      nuc09_1v2_auc: 0.6862\n      t07_1v2_auc: 0.6885\n      t12_1v2_auc: 0.7037\n      auc_1v2_range: \"[0.6862, 0.7037]\"\n      all_k_star_2: true\n      nuc09_2v3_ci_upper: 0.601\n    result_rationale: >\n      四种解码策略下 K* 完全一致=2，AUC range < 2pp。这是 median 档下 reviewer 较认可的证据——\n      解码策略不变性消除了 \"K*=2 是特定 sampling 参数的 artifact\" 的质疑。\n      但 nuc09 2v3 CI upper=0.601 接触 θ=0.60 边界，被注意但未被重点攻击（因为是 CI upper 而非 lower）。\n      Reviewer 注意到此实验仅在 Qwen rewrite mode 上做（后 exp-020 在 Pythia 上复制），\n      rewrite mode 的 higher baseline signal 使 K*=2 更容易 robust，\n      需要 continuation mode 上同样的 ablation 来增强说服力。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 3: Decoding strategy ablation\"\n        content: |\n          | Decoding | 0v1 AUC | 1v2 AUC | 2v3 AUC | K* |\n          |----------|---------|---------|---------|-----|\n          | greedy   | 0.9796  | 0.6892  | 0.5612  | 2   |\n          | nucleus p=0.9 | 0.9945 | 0.6862 | 0.5917 | 2 |\n          | T=0.7    | 0.9877  | 0.6885  | 0.5901  | 2   |\n          | T=1.2    | 0.9982  | 0.7037  | 0.5820  | 2   |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart showing K* invariance across decoding strategies, 用于 §4 主文\"\n    analysis: >\n      Decoding invariance 是 C1' 的重要支柱。Median 档 reviewer 接受此结论但权重较低\n      （\"somewhat expected — decoding shouldn't change fundamental information loss\"）。\n      exp-020 在 Pythia continuation 上的 replication 增强了此证据。\n\n  - name: \"exp-004\"\n    plan_id: \"exp_004_7b_crossscale\"\n    description: \"Qwen2.5-7B, continuation mode, C4 5K docs, scorer=Qwen2.5-1.5B\"\n    expected_results:\n      k_star: 2\n      pairwise_auc_1v2: 0.6178\n      ci_1v2_lower: 0.6079\n      ci_1v2_upper: 0.6261\n      pairwise_auc_2v3: 0.546\n      ci_2v3_upper: 0.5594\n      pairwise_auc_4v5_perm_p: 0.0676\n    result_rationale: >\n      7B scale 下 K*=2 与 1.5B 一致，CI lower=0.6079 > θ（余量 +0.79pp）。\n      在 median 档下，reviewer 接受 1.5B→7B 的 scale invariance 但力度不足：\n      (a) 只从 1.5B 到 7B 不算大幅 scale-up；(b) A3 假设被触发——至少一个 reviewer \n      标记 \"≤8B is a significant limitation, need 13B+ evidence\"。\n      4v5 pair p=0.0676 non-significant，被 reviewer 视为 \"depth ≥4 信号消失的进一步证据\"，\n      有利于 K*=2 的 claim。但 reviewer 质疑：如果更大模型（70B）生成更高质量文本，\n      K* 可能增加——作者需要 theoretically argue 或 empirically show 这一点。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 2 (row): Qwen2.5-7B C4 continuation\"\n        content: |\n          | Model | 0v1 | 1v2 | 2v3 | 3v4 | 4v5 | K* |\n          |-------|------|------|------|------|------|----|\n          | Qwen2.5-7B | 0.964 | 0.618 | 0.546 | 0.523 | 0.509 | 2 |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Scale comparison subplot: 1.5B vs 7B pairwise AUC curves overlapping\"\n    analysis: >\n      Scale invariance (1.5B→7B) 被 1 个 reviewer 认为是 \"weak evidence for scale generalization\"。\n      Rebuttal 需要 14B/32B 数据。exp_14b_c4 (K*=2) 已可用但 exp_32b_c4 仍在跑。\n      如果 32B 也给 K*=2，可在 rebuttal 中有效回应 A3。\n\n  - name: \"exp-005\"\n    plan_id: \"exp_005_degradation\"\n    description: \"Feature group ablation + degradation ordering analysis\"\n    expected_results:\n      cross_model_spearman_rho_pythia_olmo: 0.95\n      cross_model_spearman_rho_pythia_qwen_cont: 0.9143\n      cross_model_spearman_rho_olmo_qwen_cont: 0.85\n      shared_top_discriminators: \"surp_d1_std, surp_std, surp_d2_std\"\n      1v2_tau_weakness: \"~0.37\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Feature ordering 跨模型高度一致（ρ≥0.85），支持 depth signal 是 text-intrinsic 而非 model-specific。\n      Median 档下 reviewer 接受 feature ranking consistency 但不视为独立贡献——\n      \"Feature analysis is supportive but expected if the underlying signal is text-intrinsic.\"\n      1v2 pair 的 feature importance 一致性最弱（τ~0.37），被 reviewer 注意但不重点攻击\n      （因为这恰好是 boundary pair，信号最微弱处 variance 大是合理的）。\n      Surprisal-based features 主导的发现与 DPI 理论一致，被 reviewer 视为 \"expected alignment\"。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table A2: Cross-model feature ranking Spearman ρ\"\n        content: |\n          | Model Pair | Spearman ρ |\n          |------------|-----------|\n          | Pythia ↔ OLMo | 0.950 |\n          | Pythia ↔ Qwen-cont | 0.914 |\n          | OLMo ↔ Qwen-cont | 0.850 |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Feature importance heatmap across models — 放 Appendix\"\n    analysis: >\n      Supporting evidence for text-intrinsic signal。不构成独立卖点但消除 \"model self-familiarity\" 质疑。\n      Median 档下这个实验的贡献被 reviewer 归入 \"thorough analysis\" 而非 novel finding。\n\n  - name: \"exp-006\"\n    plan_id: \"exp_006_graduated_filtering\"\n    description: \"Downstream filtering evaluation: 6 strategies × 5 seeds, MMLU + HellaSwag\"\n    expected_results:\n      binary_ours_mmlu: \"0.5941±0.0008\"\n      binary_ours_hellaswag: \"0.6701±0.0006\"\n      no_filter_mmlu: \"0.5865±0.0010\"\n      no_filter_hellaswag: \"0.6638±0.0008\"\n      delta_mmlu_binary_vs_nofilter: \"+0.0076\"\n      delta_hellaswag_binary_vs_nofilter: \"+0.0063\"\n      base_model_mmlu: 0.6018\n      graduated_a09_mmlu: \"0.5892±0.0008\"\n      dsir_mmlu: \"0.5869±0.0003\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Binary-ours 在所有策略中最优，但 MMLU 增益仅 +0.76pp vs no-filter。\n      在 median 档下，这是 C3 的核心弱点（A5_fail）：\n      (a) MMLU Δ=0.76pp 被 reviewer 质疑 practical significance——\"Is <1pp improvement \n      worth the curation complexity?\"\n      (b) 所有策略都 degrade vs base_model（0.6018→0.5941），说明 contaminated data 的 \n      fundamental harm 无法被 filtering 完全消除\n      (c) Graduated α 单调递增确认 K*=2 boundary，但 reviewer 指出这是 circular reasoning——\n      用 K* 设计 filtering 然后用 filtering 验证 K*\n      (d) DSIR 表现差（接近 no-filter）是一个正面结果，但 reviewer 质疑 DSIR baseline \n      的公平性（DSIR 不是为 depth-aware filtering 设计的）\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 5: Filtering strategy comparison (Qwen2.5-1.5B, 30% contamination)\"\n        content: |\n          | Strategy | MMLU | HellaSwag | Δ MMLU vs no-filter |\n          |----------|------|-----------|-------------------|\n          | binary-ours | 0.5941±0.0008 | 0.6701±0.0006 | +0.0076* |\n          | binary-Drayson | 0.5913±0.0009 | 0.6691±0.0004 | +0.0048* |\n          | surprisal | 0.5894±0.0009 | 0.6641±0.0006 | +0.0029 |\n          | graduated α=0.9 | 0.5892±0.0008 | 0.6701±0.0007 | +0.0027 |\n          | DSIR | 0.5869±0.0003 | 0.6631±0.0007 | +0.0004 |\n          | no-filter | 0.5865±0.0010 | 0.6638±0.0008 | — |\n          | base (no contam.) | 0.6018 | 0.6821 | — |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: filtering strategies ranked by MMLU, with base_model reference line\"\n      - \"α sensitivity curve: graduated filtering MMLU as function of α\"\n    analysis: >\n      Median 档 reviewer 给 C3 的 substance score ~2.5-3.0。核心攻击点：\n      1. Effect size 太小（<1pp MMLU）不够 actionable\n      2. Binary > graduated 说明 K* boundary 信息对 curation 有用，但增益微小\n      3. 所有策略 degrade vs base_model 暗示 filtering 的 ceiling 低\n      C3 需要从 \"validation\" 降级为 \"case study / demonstration\"。\n\n  - name: \"exp-007\"\n    plan_id: \"exp_007_bootstrap_ci\"\n    description: \"K* sensitivity at θ=0.55/0.60/0.65/0.70 + bootstrap CI + permutation test\"\n    expected_results:\n      all_1v2_ci_lower_above_060: true\n      most_marginal: \"Qwen-cont CI lower=0.6015\"\n      theta_055_k_star_distribution: \"all models K*=2 or K*=3\"\n      theta_060_k_star_distribution: \"7/8 K*=2, 1/8 K*=1 (Mistral)\"\n      theta_065_k_star_distribution: \"4-5/8 K*=2, rest K*=1\"\n      theta_070_k_star_distribution: \"most K*=1\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      θ-sensitivity 是 median 档的关键攻击面（A6_partial）。\n      θ=0.60 下 7/8 configurations K*=2 被接受，但 θ=0.70 下多数降至 K*=1 被 reviewer 放大——\n      \"The finding is highly sensitive to threshold choice. At θ=0.70, the headline result \n      (K*=2 as dominant mode) collapses.\"\n      Qwen-cont CI lower=0.6015 被 A8_attacked 假设触发——reviewer 要求 sensitivity analysis \n      或额外 seeds 来确认这不是 noise。\n      论文需要在主文（非 appendix）展示 θ-sensitivity figure，正面呈现 K* 在 [0.55, 0.65] \n      范围内的稳定性，并以 Cohen's h=0.20 和 AUC gap discontinuity 为 θ=0.60 选择辩护。\n      Permutation test p<0.001 对所有 boundary pairs 提供统计支持，但 reviewer 指出 \n      \"statistical significance ≠ practical significance at these effect sizes\"。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 4: K* sensitivity to threshold θ\"\n        content: |\n          | θ | K*=1 | K*=2 | K*=3 |\n          |------|------|------|------|\n          | 0.55 | 0/8  | 7/8  | 1/8  |\n          | 0.60 | 1/8  | 7/8  | 0/8  |\n          | 0.65 | 3-4/8 | 4-5/8 | 0/8 |\n          | 0.70 | 6-7/8 | 1-2/8 | 0/8 |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"主文 Figure: θ-sensitivity heatmap，showing K* stability in [0.55, 0.65]\"\n      - \"AUC gap discontinuity plot at K* boundary pair\"\n    analysis: >\n      θ-sensitivity 被 median 档 reviewer 视为 \"fair analysis\" 但 robustness concern 未完全消除。\n      关键辩护：θ=0.60 对应 Cohen's h≈0.20（small effect size threshold），\n      且 1v2 vs 2v3 的 AUC gap 远大于 θ 选择的 sensitivity range。\n      Reviewer 接受 [0.55, 0.65] 稳定性但仍认为 \"the result is more about where you draw the line \n      than about the underlying phenomenon\"。\n\n  - name: \"exp-008\"\n    plan_id: \"exp_008_retrain_chain_v2\"\n    description: \"Retrain-chain ecological validity: Pythia-1.4B LoRA, C4 5K docs, depth 0-4\"\n    expected_results:\n      k_star: \">=4\"\n      pairwise_auc_0v1: 0.9847\n      pairwise_auc_1v2: 0.9484\n      pairwise_auc_2v3: 0.8888\n      pairwise_auc_3v4: 0.7982\n    result_rationale: >\n      Retrain-chain K*≥4 与 prompt-chain K*=2 的对比是重要的 ecological validity argument。\n      LoRA fine-tune 每代引入 cumulative model artifacts（vocabulary narrowing, repetition bias），\n      使各代高度可区分。Median 档下 reviewer 接受 \"prompt-chain isolates text-intrinsic degradation\" \n      的论点，但 1 个 reviewer 认为这说明 \"in practice, retrain-chain contamination is more \n      detectable, so K*=2 underestimates real-world detectability\"——这实际上对论文有利\n      （prompt-chain K*=2 是 conservative estimate），但 reviewer 的 framing 是 \n      \"the paper should discuss this more prominently\"。\n      3v4 AUC=0.7982 远超 θ=0.60，所有 pairs 在 retrain-chain 下都高度可区分，\n      证明 K* 的低有界性是 prompt-chain (text-intrinsic) 特有的。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 6: Prompt-chain vs Retrain-chain comparison\"\n        content: |\n          | Pair | Prompt-chain AUC | Retrain-chain AUC |\n          |------|-----------------|-------------------|\n          | 0v1  | 0.993 | 0.985 |\n          | 1v2  | 0.654 | 0.948 |\n          | 2v3  | 0.552 | 0.889 |\n          | 3v4  | 0.515 | 0.798 |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Dual-panel AUC decay: prompt-chain (sharp drop) vs retrain-chain (gradual decay)\"\n    analysis: >\n      强有力的 supporting evidence。Median 档 reviewer 肯定此实验的 ecological validity 贡献，\n      但建议正文讨论 \"real-world contamination likely falls between prompt-chain and retrain-chain\"。\n\n  - name: \"exp-009\"\n    plan_id: \"exp_009_dose_50pct\"\n    description: \"Contamination dose-response: 10%/30%/50% ratio × 3 strategies × 5 seeds\"\n    expected_results:\n      binary_consistently_best: true\n      graduated_equals_no_filter: true\n      hellaswag_binary_significant_all_ratios: true\n      mmlu_binary_30pct_p: 0.074\n      effect_size_increases_with_contamination: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Dose-response 确认 binary filtering 在所有 contamination ratio 下一致最优，\n      graduated filtering 在每个 ratio 下都崩溃至 no-filter 水平。\n      在 median 档下：\n      (a) HellaSwag 显著性是正面证据（p≤0.004 at all ratios）\n      (b) MMLU 在 30% ratio 下 p=0.074 不显著——reviewer 注意到 \"inconsistent significance \n      across benchmarks weakens the claim\"（A5_fail 部分触发）\n      (c) Effect size 随 contamination ratio 增加（10%: +0.38pp, 30%: +0.61pp, 50%: +0.51pp HellaSwag），\n      但绝对值仍然小\n      (d) 一个 reviewer 肯定 dose-response 设计的 thoroughness，但另一个认为 \n      \"50% synthetic injection is unrealistic for current web data\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 7: Dose-response analysis\"\n        content: |\n          | Ratio | Strategy | MMLU | HellaSwag |\n          |-------|----------|------|-----------|\n          | 10% | binary | 0.6079 | 0.6727** |\n          | 10% | graduated | 0.6066 | 0.6700 |\n          | 10% | no-filter | 0.6058 | 0.6689 |\n          | 30% | binary | 0.6082 | 0.6725** |\n          | 30% | graduated | 0.6072 | 0.6665 |\n          | 30% | no-filter | 0.6069 | 0.6664 |\n          | 50% | binary | 0.6088 | 0.6731** |\n          | 50% | graduated | 0.6062 | 0.6679 |\n          | 50% | no-filter | 0.6063 | 0.6680 |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Line plot: HellaSwag as function of contamination ratio, 3 strategies, with significance markers\"\n    analysis: >\n      Binary filtering 的 dose-response consistency 是 C3 的最强证据。\n      但 graduated=no-filter 的一致性同时说明 K*-aware graduated curation 无增量价值——\n      这直接削弱了 \"K* informs curation granularity\" 的 narrative。\n      Median 档下 C3 的 reviewer 评分因此在 2.5-3.0 区间。\n\n  - name: \"exp-010\"\n    plan_id: \"exp_010_ordinal_baseline\"\n    description: \"CORAL vs multiclass LightGBM vs ordinal logistic regression\"\n    expected_results:\n      obd_lgbm_best_accuracy: 0.4229\n      multiclass_lgbm_accuracy: 0.4182\n      ordinal_logreg_best_tau: 0.563\n      obd_lgbm_best_mae: 0.9836\n    result_rationale: >\n      OBD-LightGBM 在 accuracy 和 mean_pw_auc 上略优于 multiclass LightGBM，\n      但差异小（Δacc < 0.5pp）。Ordinal logistic regression MAE 最低但 accuracy 最差。\n      Median 档下 reviewer 不特别关注此实验——它是 methodology 的 supporting evidence，\n      不构成独立卖点。Reviewer 认为 \"the choice between ordinal and multiclass classifiers \n      is an implementation detail, not a contribution\"。\n      但 ordinal structure 的存在（CORAL MAE < multiclass MAE across all models）\n      为论文的 \"depth is ordinal, not categorical\" framing 提供小幅支持。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table A3: Classifier comparison\"\n        content: |\n          | Method | Acc | MAE | τ_b | Mean PW-AUC |\n          |--------|-----|-----|-----|-------------|\n          | OBD-LightGBM | 0.423 | 0.984 | 0.552 | 0.621 |\n          | Multiclass-LightGBM | 0.418 | 1.016 | 0.537 | 0.625 |\n          | Ordinal LogReg | 0.364 | 0.911 | 0.563 | 0.502 |\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      Appendix material。Median 档 reviewer 不质疑也不 highlight。\n\n  - name: \"exp-011\"\n    plan_id: \"exp_011_llm_zeroshot\"\n    description: \"GPT-5.5 / Claude Opus 4.6 zero-shot depth estimation baseline\"\n    expected_results:\n      gpt55_5class_acc: 0.332\n      claude_5class_acc: 0.331\n      gpt55_binary_acc: 0.878\n      claude_binary_acc: 0.882\n      odb_baseline_5class_acc: 0.386\n    result_rationale: >\n      Frontier LLMs 在 5-class depth estimation 上表现不如 OBD-LightGBM（33% vs 39%），\n      但 binary detection 高达 88%。这是一个 strong baseline comparison：\n      (a) 证明 depth estimation 需要 specialized features，不能 \"throw LLM at it\"\n      (b) Binary detection 高但 fine-grained depth 失败，支持 \"binary ≠ depth\" 的 claim\n      Median 档下 reviewer 对此实验评价较正面——\"Good to include, demonstrates the problem \n      is not trivially solvable.\"但 1 个 reviewer 指出 OBD 也只有 39% accuracy，\n      \"both methods are poor at fine-grained depth estimation, which raises the question \n      of whether depth estimation beyond K* is even meaningful\"。\n      这实际上对 K* characterization 有利（K* 之后的深度确实无法区分），\n      但被 reviewer 解读为对整体 contribution 的 dampener。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 8: LLM zero-shot vs OBD baseline\"\n        content: |\n          | Method | 5-class Acc | MAE | Binary Acc |\n          |--------|------------|-----|-----------|\n          | GPT-5.5 | 0.332 | 1.102 | 0.878 |\n          | Claude Opus 4.6 | 0.331 | 1.150 | 0.882 |\n          | OBD-LightGBM | 0.386 | 1.107 | — |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Per-depth accuracy heatmap: LLMs vs OBD, showing LLM failure at depth 1-4\"\n    analysis: >\n      Median 档 reviewer 正面评价此 baseline，但 McNemar test non-significant (p~0.07-0.08) \n      被注意——\"The advantage of OBD over frontier LLMs is not statistically significant.\"\n\n  - name: \"exp-012\"\n    plan_id: \"exp_012_binary_confidence\"\n    description: \"DivEye/Binoculars binary detector confidence as depth proxy\"\n    expected_results:\n      binary_detector_kstar: 1\n      obd_kstar: 2\n      spearman_rho_range: \"0.06-0.46\"\n      auc_non_monotonic: true\n      six_class_accuracy_max: 0.199\n    result_rationale: >\n      Binary detectors K*≈1 vs OBD K*=2，6-class accuracy 接近 random（≤0.199 vs 0.167 random）。\n      Spearman correlation 弱且非单调。直接支持 \"binary confidence ≠ depth\" 的 claim。\n      Median 档下 reviewer 接受此结论——\"Well-designed experiment that justifies the need for \n      depth-aware features beyond binary detection.\" 不被特别攻击。\n      但 reviewer 注意到 DivEye/Binoculars 都是 perplexity-based，\n      建议加入 watermark-based 或 learned detectors 作为 baseline。论文无此 baseline \n      被视为 minor weakness 而非 major concern。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table A4: Binary detector depth estimation\"\n        content: |\n          | Generator | 6-class Acc | ρ (ppl_ratio) | AUC monotonic? |\n          |-----------|------------|--------------|---------------|\n          | Qwen-rw | 0.199 | 0.119 | ❌ |\n          | Pythia | 0.130 | -0.392 | ❌ |\n          | OLMo | 0.127 | -0.407 | ❌ |\n          | Qwen-cont | 0.183 | -0.058 | ❌ |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Scatter plot: binary detector confidence vs true depth, showing non-monotonicity\"\n    analysis: >\n      Strong justification for the paper's approach。Median 档下被 reviewer 正面引用。\n\n  - name: \"exp-013\"\n    plan_id: \"exp_013_cross_transfer\"\n    description: \"4×4 cross-model transfer matrix\"\n    expected_results:\n      pythia_olmo_retention: \"91-92%\"\n      qwen_cont_cross_retention: \"80-85%\"\n      qwen_rw_cross_retention: \"61-63%\"\n      binary_0v1_cross_all_above_096: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Cross-model transfer 是 C1' \"text-intrinsic signal\" 的核心证据。\n      Pythia↔OLMo 91-92% retention 和 0v1 cross-AUC > 0.96 强力支持 depth signal 跨模型可迁移。\n      Median 档下 reviewer 正面评价：\n      (a) \"The high transfer retention confirms K* is not a self-familiarity artifact\"\n      (b) Qwen-rewrite 低 transfer (61-63%) 进一步区分 generation mode effect vs depth signal\n      (c) 但 reviewer 指出 \"all models are ≤8B from similar training distributions, \n      transfer to fundamentally different models (e.g., 70B, multilingual) remains unknown\"\n      这与 A3 (scale limitation) 呼应。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 9: Cross-model transfer retention\"\n        content: |\n          | Transfer Direction | Accuracy Retention |\n          |-------------------|-------------------|\n          | Pythia → OLMo | 92% |\n          | OLMo → Pythia | 91% |\n          | Qwen-cont → Pythia | 85% |\n          | Qwen-cont → OLMo | 80% |\n          | Qwen-rw → Pythia | 63% |\n          | Qwen-rw → OLMo | 61% |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"4×4 transfer heatmap in main text\"\n    analysis: >\n      Median 档 reviewer 评价：C1' 的 strongest supporting evidence 之一。\n      Transfer > 80% 在 continuation mode 下消除 scorer bias 质疑。\n\n  - name: \"exp-014\"\n    plan_id: null\n    description: \"Naturalistic validation: Common Crawl 2025/2026 snapshot depth prediction\"\n    expected_results:\n      predicted_depth_distribution:\n        depth_0: \"60-75%\"\n        depth_1: \"15-25%\"\n        depth_2_plus: \"5-15%\"\n      correlation_with_alignscore: \"Spearman ρ=0.15-0.30\"\n      correlation_with_vocab_richness: \"Spearman ρ=0.20-0.35\"\n      predicted_contamination_rate: \"25-40%\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Naturalistic validation 在 median 档下是 P2 优先级，未执行。\n      如果执行，预期结果：Common Crawl 2025/2026 中约 25-40% 文本被预测为 depth ≥1（合成文本），\n      与外部估计一致。但 ground truth 缺失使此实验无法做定量验证——\n      只能做 correlation with proxy metrics。AlignScore correlation 弱（ρ~0.15-0.30）\n      因为 AlignScore 度量的是事实一致性而非 generational depth。\n      Vocab richness correlation 略强（ρ~0.20-0.35）因为递归生成确实导致 vocabulary narrowing。\n      Median 档 reviewer 对此实验缺失不会严重扣分（P2 priority），\n      但 1 个 reviewer 可能建议 \"a naturalistic study would strengthen the paper's practical relevance\"。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      未执行。Median 档下不影响核心评分但作为 future work 建议出现在 reviewer comments 中。\n\n  - name: \"exp-015\"\n    plan_id: \"exp_015_neural_probe\"\n    description: \"Frozen Qwen2.5-1.5B embeddings + MLP probe vs 15D features\"\n    expected_results:\n      pythia_k_star_neural: 2\n      olmo_k_star_neural: 2\n      qwen_cont_k_star_neural: 3\n      qwen_cont_2v3_neural_auc: 0.616\n      qwen_cont_2v3_neural_ci_lower: 0.6099\n    result_rationale: >\n      Neural probe 结果分裂：Pythia/OLMo K*_neural=2（与 15D 一致），Qwen-cont K*_neural=3（高于 15D）。\n      Qwen-cont 的差异来自 self-scorer advantage——Qwen 的 embeddings 对自己生成的文本有额外 depth signal。\n      Median 档下 reviewer 解读：\n      (a) Pythia/OLMo K*_neural=2 confirms \"K*=2 is data-intrinsic, not feature-engineering artifact\"\n      (b) Qwen K*_neural=3 被 reviewer 解读为 \"model-dependent K* exists in learned representations, \n      which contradicts the 'K* is purely text-intrinsic' narrative\"\n      (c) 论文需要 careful framing：model-free 15D features 给出 universal K*，\n      neural probe 给出 model-dependent K*——两者都是 valid 但 serve different purposes\n      (d) 这实际上是 A8_attacked 的延伸——Qwen self-scorer 的 +1 bias 在 neural probe 中更明显\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table A5: Neural probe vs 15D features\"\n        content: |\n          | Model | K*(15D) | K*(neural) | 2v3 AUC (neural) |\n          |-------|---------|-----------|-----------------|\n          | Pythia-1.4B | 2 | 2 | 0.596 |\n          | OLMo-1B | 2 | 2 | 0.589 |\n          | Qwen-cont | 2 | 3 | 0.616 |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Comparison bar chart: 15D vs neural probe pairwise AUC, per model\"\n    analysis: >\n      Median 档下 reviewer 接受 \"model-free features for headline K*\" 的选择，\n      但 Qwen K*_neural=3 被部分 reviewer 用来质疑 K*=2 universality。\n      需要 framing: \"K*(neural) is representation-dependent; K*(model-free) is the conservative, \n      universal measure we recommend for cross-model comparisons.\"\n\n  - name: \"exp-016\"\n    plan_id: \"exp_016_base_vs_instruct\"\n    description: \"Qwen2.5-1.5B base vs Instruct continuation mode comparison\"\n    expected_results:\n      k_star: 2\n      base_1v2_auc: 0.6262\n      base_ci_lower: 0.6168\n      instruct_1v2_auc: 0.6112\n      instruct_ci_lower: 0.6015\n      ci_overlap: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Base 和 Instruct K* 一致=2，CI 重叠说明 instruction tuning 不改变 K*。\n      但 base 1v2 AUC (0.6262) > instruct (0.6112)，即 instruction tuning 轻微降低 \n      depth discrimination signal（可能因为 RLHF 增加了生成多样性）。\n      Median 档下 reviewer 不特别关注此实验——\"Expected result, instruction tuning should \n      not fundamentally change text-intrinsic depth properties.\"\n      但 base CI lower=0.6168 vs instruct CI lower=0.6015 的差距被注意——\n      如果 instruction tuning 进一步降低 signal（如更强的 RLHF），K* 可能降至 1。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table A6: Base vs Instruct\"\n        content: |\n          | Variant | 1v2 AUC | 95% CI | K* |\n          |---------|---------|--------|-----|\n          | Base | 0.626 | [0.617, 0.635] | 2 |\n          | Instruct | 0.611 | [0.602, 0.621] | 2 |\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      Supporting evidence for K* robustness across base/instruct variants。不是 highlight。\n\n  - name: \"exp-017\"\n    plan_id: \"exp_017_qwen_continuation\"\n    description: \"Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct continuation mode, C4 5K docs, depth 0-5\"\n    expected_results:\n      k_star: 2\n      pairwise_auc_1v2: 0.6112\n      ci_1v2_lower: 0.6015\n      pairwise_auc_2v3: 0.5609\n    result_rationale: >\n      Qwen-cont 1v2 AUC=0.6112，CI lower=0.6015——仅高于 θ 0.15pp。\n      在 median 档下这是 A8_attacked 的核心：reviewer 单独点名 \"CI lower=0.6015 is dangerously \n      close to the threshold. A few different random seeds could flip this to K*=1.\"\n      要求 sensitivity analysis：(a) 额外 seeds/bootstrap resamples，(b) θ 微调下的稳定性，\n      (c) cross-scorer validation 下的变化。\n      exp-022 中 qwen_cont256×pythia K*=1 (1v2=0.5979) 进一步加剧了这个 concern——\n      当 scorer 从 Qwen 换成 Pythia 时，Qwen-cont 确实可以翻转为 K*=1。\n      论文需要承认 Qwen-cont 处于 K*=1 和 K*=2 的边界，并以此作为 θ-sensitivity 讨论的案例。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 2 (row): Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct continuation\"\n        content: |\n          | Model | 0v1 | 1v2 | 2v3 | 3v4 | 4v5 | K* |\n          |-------|------|------|------|------|------|----|\n          | Qwen-1.5B-Inst cont | 0.997 | 0.611 | 0.561 | 0.541 | 0.514 | 2 |\n          | 95% CI (1v2) | — | [0.602, 0.621] | — | — | — | — |\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      Median 档核心攻击目标。需要在论文中显式承认 borderline nature 并提供多层辩护。\n      Cross-scorer 和 θ-sensitivity 数据在正文中呈现而非藏在 appendix。\n\n  - name: \"exp-018\"\n    plan_id: \"exp_018_llama8b_depth\"\n    description: \"LLaMA-3.1-8B, continuation mode, C4 5K docs, scorer=Qwen2.5-1.5B\"\n    expected_results:\n      k_star: 2\n      pairwise_auc_1v2: 0.6123\n      ci_1v2_lower: 0.6028\n      ci_1v2_upper: 0.6216\n    result_rationale: >\n      LLaMA-8B K*=2，CI lower=0.6028 (余量 +0.28pp)。\n      第三个模型家族确认 C4 K*=2，增强跨架构证据。\n      Median 档下 reviewer 接受 LLaMA 结果但注意到：\n      (a) CI lower=0.6028 也较边缘（虽不如 Qwen-cont 的 0.6015 极端）\n      (b) 0v1 AUC=0.9225 是所有模型中最低的——暗示 LLaMA 的 continuation \n      生成与原文更相似（model quality 更高），导致整体 signal 更弱\n      (c) 但 K* 仍=2，支持 \"K* is domain-determined regardless of absolute signal strength\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 2 (row): LLaMA-3.1-8B C4 continuation\"\n        content: |\n          | Model | 0v1 | 1v2 | 2v3 | 3v4 | 4v5 | K* |\n          |-------|------|------|------|------|------|----|\n          | LLaMA-3.1-8B | 0.923 | 0.612 | 0.527 | 0.514 | 0.510 | 2 |\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      LLaMA 的低 0v1 AUC (0.9225 vs others >0.96) 被 median 档 reviewer 解读为 \n      \"larger models produce more human-like text\"——这与 A3 (scale limitation) 呼应：\n      更大模型可能导致 0v1 也接近 threshold。\n\n  - name: \"exp-019\"\n    plan_id: \"exp_019_mistral7b_depth\"\n    description: \"Mistral-7B-v0.3, continuation mode, C4 5K docs, scorer=Qwen2.5-1.5B\"\n    expected_results:\n      k_star: 1\n      pairwise_auc_1v2: 0.5935\n      ci_1v2_lower: 0.5835\n      ci_1v2_upper: 0.6032\n      p_auc_leq_060: 0.9017\n    result_rationale: >\n      Mistral K*=1 是唯一的 C4 outlier（7/8 K*=2 中的例外）。\n      1v2 AUC=0.5935 < θ=0.60，CI upper=0.6032 仅微超 θ，说明 Mistral 一代后即 one-wash。\n      Median 档下的 reviewer 反应分裂：\n      (a) Reviewer A 接受 \"7/8 dominant mode K*=2, with Mistral as interpretable outlier\"\n      (b) Reviewer B 攻击 \"If 1/8 models gives K*=1, how can you claim K*=2 is universal? \n      This is evidence of model×domain interaction, not pure domain dependence.\"\n      Cross-scorer validation (exp-019b) 确认 K*=1 是 text-intrinsic（non-scorer artifact），\n      但这并不能回应 \"model matters\" 的质疑。\n      Mistral arXiv K*=3 (exp_arXiv_mistral7b) 是关键回应——同一模型在不同域给出不同 K*，\n      证明 domain 仍是 primary factor。但 reviewer 认为这只是 \"primary, not sole\"。\n      论文需要从 \"sole determinant\" 降级为 \"primary factor, with residual model effects\"。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 2 (row): Mistral-7B C4 continuation (K*=1 outlier)\"\n        content: |\n          | Model | 0v1 | 1v2 | 2v3 | 3v4 | 4v5 | K* |\n          |-------|------|------|------|------|------|----|\n          | Mistral-7B | 0.984 | 0.594 | 0.540 | 0.523 | 0.518 | 1 |\n          | 95% CI (1v2) | — | [0.584, 0.603] | — | — | — | — |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Highlighted outlier point in K* summary figure, with cross-scorer validation annotation\"\n    analysis: >\n      Median 档核心攻击点之一。论文需要正面讨论 Mistral K*=1 而非 downplay，\n      并用 Mistral arXiv K*=3 证明 domain 仍是 primary driver。\n      \"Sole determinant\" → \"primary factor\" 的降级措辞是 median 档的必要调整。\n\n  - name: \"exp-020\"\n    plan_id: \"exp_020_pythia_decoding\"\n    description: \"Pythia-1.4B decoding ablation: 4 strategies, C4 5K docs, depth 0-5\"\n    expected_results:\n      all_k_star_2: true\n      greedy_1v2: 0.8838\n      nuc09_1v2: 0.677\n      t07_1v2: 0.7265\n      t12_1v2: 0.6172\n    result_rationale: >\n      Pythia 上 4 种解码策略 K* 全部=2，跨模型复制 exp-003 的解码不变性。\n      Greedy 1v2=0.8838 极高——因为 greedy decoding 引入 repetition collapse，\n      使 depth 1 和 depth 2 文本差异大。T=1.2 的 1v2=0.6172 最低（高温增加随机性，模糊差异）。\n      Median 档下 reviewer 正面评价跨模型 decoding invariance：\n      \"K*=2 holds across 2 models × 4 decoding strategies = 8 conditions, which is convincing.\"\n      但 greedy 的异常高 AUC 被注意——\"greedy is a degenerate condition that amplifies artifacts, \n      it shouldn't be treated as equally valid.\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table A7: Pythia decoding ablation\"\n        content: |\n          | Decoding | 1v2 AUC | 2v3 AUC | K* |\n          |----------|---------|---------|-----|\n          | greedy | 0.884 | 0.534 | 2 |\n          | nucleus p=0.9 | 0.677 | 0.555 | 2 |\n          | T=0.7 | 0.727 | 0.594 | 2 |\n          | T=1.2 | 0.617 | 0.523 | 2 |\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      Supporting evidence，放 Appendix。Greedy 的 repetition collapse 作为 caveat 在正文中提及。\n\n  - name: \"exp-021\"\n    plan_id: \"exp_021_length_ablation\"\n    description: \"Text length ablation: 128/256/512 tokens, Qwen continuation\"\n    expected_results:\n      128tok_k_star: 2\n      256tok_k_star: 2\n      512tok_k_star: 2\n      512tok_1v2_ci_lower: 0.5979\n      512tok_verdict: \"BORDERLINE\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      K*=2 在三种长度下一致。但 512tok 的 CI lower=0.5979 < θ 是 borderline failure——\n      在 median 档下 reviewer 注意到 \"longer texts paradoxically reduce discriminability, \n      which is counter-intuitive and requires explanation.\"\n      解释：512 tokens 的 continuation 更有空间 converge to the generator's style，\n      使 depth 1 和 depth 2 更相似。这与 \"one-wash laundering\" 概念一致。\n      但 reviewer 认为 \"if the result flips at 512 tokens, the 256-token headline results \n      may be cherry-picking the optimal length.\"\n      论文需要承认 length sensitivity 并在主文讨论。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table A8: Length ablation\"\n        content: |\n          | Length | 1v2 AUC | CI lower | K* |\n          |--------|---------|---------|-----|\n          | 128 tok | 0.622 | >0.60 | 2 |\n          | 256 tok | 0.628 | >0.60 | 2 |\n          | 512 tok | 0.607 | 0.598 | 2* |\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      512-token borderline 被 median 档 reviewer 视为 minor concern。\n      与 Qwen-cont CI lower=0.6015 的边缘性一起被归入 \"robustness limitations\" 段。\n\n  - name: \"exp-022\"\n    plan_id: \"exp_022_cross_scorer_matrix\"\n    description: \"4×4 cross-scorer matrix: 4 generators × 4 scorers\"\n    expected_results:\n      k_star_2_count: 11\n      k_star_1_count: 1\n      exception: \"qwen_cont256×pythia (1v2=0.5979)\"\n      scorer_delta_within_generator: \"<0.025\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      11/12 combos K*=2 是 scorer independence 的强证据。\n      唯一例外 qwen_cont256×pythia (K*=1) 被 reviewer 注意但不被严重攻击——\n      因为 Qwen-cont 本身就是最 marginal 的 generator（CI lower=0.6015），\n      换 scorer 后 flip 到 K*=1 是 consistent with its borderline nature。\n      Median 档下 reviewer 正面评价：\"Scorer independence is well-established. \n      The paper correctly identifies and discusses the single exception.\"\n      但 A8_attacked 的 reviewer 用这个数据加强攻击：\"Even with different scorers, \n      Qwen-cont is unstable.\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 10: Cross-scorer matrix (selected)\"\n        content: |\n          | Generator × Scorer | 1v2 AUC | K* |\n          |-------------------|---------|-----|\n          | Qwen-base × OLMo | 0.605 | 2 |\n          | Qwen-base × Pythia | 0.617 | 2 |\n          | Qwen-cont × Pythia | 0.598 | 1 |\n          | Qwen-cont × Qwen-base | 0.628 | 2 |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"4×4 heatmap of K* values in cross-scorer matrix\"\n    analysis: >\n      Scorer independence confirmed。论文在正文中展示完整矩阵以预防 \"self-scorer bias\" 攻击。\n\n  - name: \"exp-023\"\n    plan_id: \"exp_023_domain_ablation\"\n    description: \"Wikipedia domain, Qwen2.5-1.5B base continuation, 5K docs, depth 0-5\"\n    expected_results:\n      k_star: 2\n      one_v_two_auc: 0.6193\n      all_folds_above_060: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Wikipedia K*=2 (same-family scorer) 但经 D060 cross-scorer confound 分析后降为 K*=1。\n      这是 median 档中 scorer confound 的 key demonstration：\n      Qwen same-family scorer 在 Wikipedia 上给出 +1 bias（K*=2），\n      换 Pythia cross-family scorer 后 K*=1。\n      论文正文报告 scorer-controlled K*=1 for Wikipedia, Appendix 披露 confound 细节。\n      Reviewer 接受 confound 控制但质疑：\"If the simplest domain already saturates at K*=1, \n      and web text at K*=2, the range {1,2,3} is very narrow. \n      Is the finding essentially that recursive generation quickly loses information?\"\n      这触发 A1 (\"somewhat expected\")。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 11 (row): Wikipedia domain K*\"\n        content: |\n          | Domain | Scorer | 1v2 AUC | K* |\n          |--------|--------|---------|-----|\n          | Wikipedia | Qwen (same-family) | 0.619 | 2 |\n          | Wikipedia | Pythia (cross-family) | 0.585 | 1 |\n          | Wikipedia | scorer-controlled | — | 1 |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Domain ladder figure: Wikipedia(1) < C4(2) < arXiv(3)\"\n    analysis: >\n      Scorer confound on Wikipedia 是 honest reporting，增加论文可信度。\n      但 K*=1 for Wikipedia 被 reviewer 解读为 \"trivial — one generation washes everything.\"\n\n  - name: \"exp-024\"\n    plan_id: \"exp_024_arxiv_domain\"\n    description: \"arXiv domain, Qwen2.5-1.5B base continuation, 5K docs, depth 0-5\"\n    expected_results:\n      k_star: 3\n      pairwise_auc_1v2: 0.858\n      pairwise_auc_2v3: 0.6427\n      ci_2v3_lower: 0.6275\n    result_rationale: >\n      arXiv K*=3 是 domain dependence 的最强证据——首个 K*>2 的条件。\n      2v3 AUC=0.6427, CI lower=0.6275 >> θ=0.60（余量 +2.75pp）。\n      1v2 AUC=0.858 远超 C4/Wiki (~0.61-0.69)，arXiv 的 LaTeX/citation/math \n      结构特征提供额外 depth-distinguishing signal。\n      Median 档下 reviewer 反应：\n      (a) 正面：K*=3 on arXiv is a genuinely interesting finding, domain dependence is well-demonstrated\n      (b) 攻击：A2 假设触发——\"3 domains is too few to claim 'domain is the sole determinant'. \n      What about code, legal text, news, social media?\"\n      (c) 建议：需要更多域来充分支持 domain hierarchy claim\n      论文需要降级措辞从 \"sole determinant\" 到 \"primary factor\"，\n      承认 3 domains 是 initial evidence 而非 exhaustive characterization。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 11 (row): arXiv domain K*\"\n        content: |\n          | Domain | 1v2 AUC | 2v3 AUC | 3v4 AUC | K* |\n          |--------|---------|---------|---------|-----|\n          | arXiv | 0.858 | 0.643 | 0.544 | 3 |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"AUC decay curves: 3 domains overlaid, showing domain-dependent saturation points\"\n    analysis: >\n      K*=3 on arXiv 是论文的 strongest individual finding，但 3-domain limitation 被 reviewer 攻击。\n      exp_027 LaTeX ablation (K*=3 preserved after stripping) 有效消除格式 confound。\n\n  - name: \"exp-025\"\n    plan_id: \"exp_025_pythia_filtering\"\n    description: \"Pythia-1.4B filtering replication: 3 strategies × 3 seeds\"\n    expected_results:\n      all_strategies_nearly_identical: true\n      max_delta_mmlu: 0.0017\n      binary_hellaswag_delta: \"+0.0000\"\n      key_finding: \"null result\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Pythia-1.4B 上三种策略产生几乎相同结果（max Δ=0.0017 MMLU），filtering ordering 未确认。\n      Median 档下这是 C3 的严重打击（A5_fail 部分）：\n      (a) Pythia 太小（1.4B, MMLU~0.26）对 filtering signal 不敏感——模型 capacity 不足\n      (b) 但 reviewer 质疑 \"if filtering doesn't help even small models, why should we trust \n      it helps larger ones?\"\n      (c) 论文需要 framing：Pythia 的 base capability 太低（MMLU=0.26 接近 random），\n      filtering 的 marginal benefit 在 low-capability regime 被淹没\n      (d) 这个 null result 被 1 个 reviewer 肯定（\"honest reporting of negative results\"），\n      被另一个 reviewer 用来质疑 C3 整体证据链\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table A9: Pythia filtering (null result)\"\n        content: |\n          | Strategy | MMLU | HellaSwag |\n          |----------|------|-----------|\n          | binary-ours | 0.259±0.000 | 0.525±0.000 |\n          | graduated α=0.9 | 0.256±0.001 | 0.525±0.001 |\n          | no-filter | 0.257±0.001 | 0.525±0.001 |\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      Null result。放 Appendix 作为 honest reporting。\n      C3 的证据链因此完全依赖 exp-006 (Qwen) 和 exp-009 (dose-response)。\n      Median 档 reviewer 评价 C3 substance ~2.5。\n\n  - name: \"exp-026\"\n    plan_id: \"exp_026_arxiv_filtering\"\n    description: \"arXiv graduated vs binary filtering: Qwen base + LoRA, K*=3 domain, 3 strategies × 5 seeds\"\n    expected_results:\n      graduated_equals_no_filter: true\n      binary_mmlu_delta: \"-0.0023\"\n      binary_hellaswag_delta: \"+0.0042\"\n      graduated_mmlu_delta: \"+0.0001\"\n      graduated_hellaswag_delta: \"-0.0001\"\n      key_finding: \"null result — graduated ≈ no_filter on K*=3 domain\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      这是 C3 的 fatal blow：即使在 K*=3 域（理论上 graduated 应该有优势），\n      graduated ≈ no_filter，binary 有 metric-specific trade-off（MMLU -0.23pp, HellaSwag +0.42pp）。\n      Median 档下 A5_fail 完全触发：\n      (a) \"If graduated filtering fails even on K*=3 where it should work best, \n      the entire K*-aware curation thesis is undermined\"\n      (b) 论文需要将 C3 降级为 \"case study\" 而非 \"validation\"\n      (c) 关键 insight（放 Discussion）：K* characterizes signal discriminability, \n      not data utility — depth 2-3 text is statistically distinguishable but removing it \n      doesn't improve training\n      (d) Binary filtering 的 HellaSwag 优势可能来自 removing any synthetic data \n      (regardless of depth)，而非 depth-aware curation\n      (e) 1 个 reviewer 肯定这个 negative result 的 honesty，\n      但另一个 reviewer 认为 C3 整体不成立\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 12: arXiv filtering results (negative)\"\n        content: |\n          | Strategy | MMLU | HellaSwag | Δ MMLU | Δ HellaSwag |\n          |----------|------|-----------|--------|-------------|\n          | no-filter | 0.590±0.001 | 0.660±0.000 | — | — |\n          | binary | 0.588±0.000 | 0.664±0.000 | -0.002 | +0.004* |\n          | graduated α=0.9 | 0.590±0.001 | 0.660±0.000 | +0.000 | -0.000 |\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      Negative result honestly reported。Section 5 adds this as \"boundary conditions of K*-aware curation.\"\n      Discussion adds key insight: \"K* ≠ data utility.\" \n      Median 档 negative_result_credibility_boost = 0.0-0.5（modest boost from honesty, \n      offset by weakened C3）。\n\n  - name: \"exp-027\"\n    plan_id: \"exp_027_latex_ablation\"\n    description: \"LaTeX markup removal ablation on arXiv data\"\n    expected_results:\n      k_star_preserved: true\n      original_2v3: 0.6436\n      stripped_2v3: 0.6229\n      delta_2v3: -0.021\n    result_rationale: >\n      K*=3 在去除 LaTeX 标记后保持，2v3 AUC 从 0.6436 降至 0.6229 但仍 > θ=0.60。\n      LaTeX 格式贡献约 2pp AUC 但不是 K*=3 的 confound。\n      Median 档下 reviewer 正面评价：\"Good ablation that rules out the obvious confound. \n      K*=3 on arXiv is driven by content structural complexity, not just formatting.\"\n      但 reviewer 注意到 stripped 2v3=0.6229 余量仅 +2.29pp，如果进一步去除 \n      other structural markers (citation patterns, section numbering), K* 可能降至 2。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table A10: LaTeX ablation\"\n        content: |\n          | Condition | 1v2 AUC | 2v3 AUC | K* |\n          |-----------|---------|---------|-----|\n          | Original | 0.858 | 0.644 | 3 |\n          | LaTeX stripped | 0.830 | 0.623 | 3 |\n          | Δ | -0.028 | -0.021 | — |\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      Effective confound control。Median 档 reviewer 不攻击此实验。\n\n  - name: \"exp-028\"\n    plan_id: null\n    description: \"Subsampling power curve: C4 n={1000,2000,3000,4000,5000} × 10 resamples\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_1000_k_star_2_rate: \"6-7/10 (unstable)\"\n      n_2000_k_star_2_rate: \"8-9/10 (mostly stable)\"\n      n_3000_k_star_2_rate: \"9-10/10 (stable)\"\n      n_5000_k_star_2_rate: \"10/10 (robust)\"\n      minimum_n_for_robust_k_star: \"~2500-3000\"\n      ci_width_at_n_1000: \"±0.025-0.030\"\n      ci_width_at_n_5000: \"±0.010-0.012\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Power analysis 在 median 档下是 reviewer 可能要求但非 P0 的实验。如果执行：\n      n=1000 时 CI 太宽（±2.5-3.0pp），K*=2 判定在约 60-70% resamples 中成立——不 robust。\n      n=3000 时稳定，n=5000 完全 robust。\n      这回应了 reviewer 对 sample size 的潜在质疑，并提供 practical guidance：\n      \"K*=2 判定需要 ≥2500 samples per depth pair for 90% power.\"\n      Median 档下如果缺少此实验，reviewer 可能在 Minor Revisions 中要求补充。\n      如果存在，被评为 \"useful methodological contribution for practitioners.\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table A11: Subsampling power curve\"\n        content: |\n          | n | K*=2 rate | 1v2 CI width | Median 1v2 AUC |\n          |------|-----------|-------------|---------------|\n          | 1000 | 65% | ±0.028 | 0.652 |\n          | 2000 | 85% | ±0.019 | 0.653 |\n          | 3000 | 95% | ±0.015 | 0.654 |\n          | 4000 | 98% | ±0.012 | 0.654 |\n          | 5000 | 100% | ±0.010 | 0.654 |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Power curve: K*=2 detection rate as function of sample size\"\n    analysis: >\n      未执行（planned）。如果在 rebuttal 中补充，可回应 \"statistical power\" 质疑。\n      Median 档 reviewer 不会因缺失此实验降分但可能作为 minor revision 要求。\n\n  # Additional experiments from registry (not in original plan but executed)\n\n  - name: \"exp_arXiv_cross_validation (5-model)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp_arXiv_llama8b / exp_arXiv_mistral7b / exp_arXiv_qwen7b / exp_025_pythia_arxiv\"\n    description: \"arXiv K*=3 cross-validation: 5 models × 4 architecture families\"\n    expected_results:\n      qwen_1b5_k_star: 3\n      pythia_k_star: 3\n      llama_8b_k_star: 3\n      mistral_7b_k_star: 3\n      qwen_7b_k_star: 3\n      olmo_k_star: 1\n      domain_competent_models_k3_rate: \"5/5 (100%)\"\n      olmo_capacity_failure: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      五个 domain-competent 模型在 arXiv 上 100% 一致 K*=3（跨 4 架构族）。\n      OLMo-1B K*=1 因 capacity failure（生成出域文本）。\n      Median 档下 reviewer 高度正面评价 domain dependence evidence：\n      \"5/5 domain-competent models all yielding K*=3 on arXiv is strong cross-validation.\"\n      但 A2 仍被触发——\"Even with 5-model cross-validation, 3 domains is still 3 domains. \n      The domain hierarchy Wikipedia(1)<C4(2)<arXiv(3) could just be ordered by text complexity.\"\n      Reviewer 建议增加 code/legal/social media domains。\n      OLMo capacity failure 被正面引用：\"Correctly identified as prerequisite analysis, \n      not counted against the domain claim.\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 13: arXiv K*=3 cross-validation\"\n        content: |\n          | Model | Family | 2v3 AUC | K* |\n          |-------|--------|---------|-----|\n          | Qwen-1.5B | Qwen | 0.643 | 3 |\n          | Pythia-1.4B | GPT-NeoX | 0.654 | 3 |\n          | LLaMA-8B | LLaMA | 0.622 | 3 |\n          | Mistral-7B | Mistral | 0.628 | 3 |\n          | Qwen-7B | Qwen | 0.626 | 3 |\n          | OLMo-1B | OLMo | 0.503 | 1 (capacity fail) |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: arXiv 2v3 AUC across 5 models, all > θ=0.60 (except OLMo marked separately)\"\n    analysis: >\n      Domain dependence 的 crown jewel evidence。Mistral C4 K*=1 → arXiv K*=3 的跃变\n      是论文最有说服力的 single finding。Median 档 reviewer 评分：\n      soundness 3.0-3.5 for C1' domain dependence sub-claim。\n\n  - name: \"exp_wiki_scorer_confound\"\n    plan_id: \"D060 scorer confound analysis\"\n    description: \"Wikipedia scorer confound: Qwen same-family vs Pythia cross-family scorer\"\n    expected_results:\n      qwen_scorer_k_star: 2\n      pythia_crossscorer_k_star: 1\n      critical_delta_1v2: -0.024\n      confound_verdict: \"confirmed\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Wikipedia 上 Qwen same-family scorer 给出 K*=2，换 Pythia cross-family scorer 后降为 K*=1。\n      Δ1v2=-0.024 证明 +1 bias 存在。Median 档下：\n      (a) Reviewer 肯定 confound detection and control：\"Good scientific practice to identify \n      and report scorer bias.\"\n      (b) 论文正文报告 K*=1 (scorer-controlled)，增加可信度\n      (c) 但 reviewer 追问：\"If same-family scorer bias exists on Wikipedia, \n      could it also affect C4 results (e.g., Qwen-cont CI lower=0.6015)?\"\n      (d) Exp-022 的 cross-scorer matrix 部分回应这个问题（C4 上 11/12 K*=2），\n      但 Qwen-cont×Pythia K*=1 加剧 concern\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table A12: Wikipedia scorer confound\"\n        content: |\n          | Scorer | 1v2 AUC | K* |\n          |--------|---------|-----|\n          | Qwen (same-family) | 0.619 | 2 |\n          | Pythia (cross-family) | 0.587 | 1 |\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      Honest reporting 增加论文可信度。Median 档 reviewer 正面评价但用此质疑 C4 结果。\n\n  - name: \"exp_14b_c4\"\n    plan_id: \"scale extension\"\n    description: \"Qwen2.5-14B, continuation mode, C4, depth 0-5 — scale extension for rebuttal\"\n    expected_results:\n      k_star: 2\n      pairwise_auc_1v2: 0.621\n      ci_1v2_lower: 0.6119\n      ci_1v2_upper: 0.6304\n    result_rationale: >\n      14B scale 下 K*=2 维持，CI lower=0.6119 > θ（余量 +1.19pp）。\n      这是回应 A3 (scale limitation) 的关键 rebuttal evidence：\n      \"K*=2 is confirmed from 1.4B to 14B (10× scale range), with consistent CI lower > θ.\"\n      Median 档下如果在 rebuttal 中呈现：\n      (a) 1 个 reviewer 接受 \"14B extends the scale range meaningfully\"\n      (b) 但要求 32B 数据来确认 trend\n      (c) exp_32b_c4 正在运行——如果也是 K*=2，rebuttal 极大增强\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Rebuttal Table R1: Scale extension\"\n        content: |\n          | Scale | 1v2 AUC | CI lower | K* |\n          |-------|---------|---------|-----|\n          | 1.4B (Pythia) | 0.654 | 0.645 | 2 |\n          | 1.5B (Qwen) | 0.611 | 0.602 | 2 |\n          | 7B (Qwen) | 0.618 | 0.608 | 2 |\n          | 8B (LLaMA) | 0.612 | 0.603 | 2 |\n          | 14B (Qwen) | 0.621 | 0.612 | 2 |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Scale plot: K* and 1v2 AUC as function of model size — flat trend confirms scale invariance\"\n    analysis: >\n      Rebuttal 核心证据。1.4B→14B 10× scale range 下 K*=2 一致。\n      如果 32B 也确认，可有效回应 A3，将 reviewer 从 \"significant weakness\" 降为 \"minor limitation\"。\n\n  - name: \"exp_026_arxiv_filtering_integrated\"\n    plan_id: \"what_if\"\n    description: \"arXiv graduated filtering negative result integrated into paper narrative\"\n    expected_results:\n      section_5_addition: \"arXiv null result table with paired t-tests\"\n      discussion_insight: \"K* ≠ data utility\"\n      negative_result_credibility_boost: \"0.0-0.5\"\n      c3_downgrade: \"validation → case study\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      将 exp-026 negative result 正式整合入论文：Section 5 增加 arXiv null result，\n      Discussion 增加 \"K* characterizes discriminability, not utility\" 洞察。\n      Median 档下的效果：\n      (a) 1 个 reviewer 明确肯定 honest reporting：\"The authors' willingness to report \n      negative results and adjust claims accordingly is commendable.\"\n      (b) 但 credibility boost 被 C3 整体弱化所抵消——honestly reporting failure \n      doesn't make the contribution stronger, it just makes the paper more trustworthy\n      (c) \"K* ≠ data utility\" insight 被 1 个 reviewer 视为 \"interesting secondary finding\"\n      但另一个 reviewer 认为 \"this undermines the practical motivation of the paper\"\n      (d) C3 contribution 从 \"validation that K* informs optimal filtering granularity\" \n      降级为 \"case study demonstrating that K*-aware binary filtering provides modest \n      improvement on web text, with boundary conditions on other domains\"\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      整合 negative results 是 median 档下的最优策略。\n      完全不报告 → reviewer 如果知道了会更严厉；过度辩护 → 不可信。\n      \"Case study\" framing 是平衡点：承认 limitation 但保留 positive evidence (exp-006, exp-009)。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7519,"cache_read_input_tokens":61666,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":7519},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"683b9cc9-54dc-4394-94b0-6cb221bad393","uuid":"6e32edd4-9676-43c4-a40a-70c8fb1a